that do not install Plymouth at all. KIWI skips\n\t\t  this silently when the tool is absent, which is what makes it safe here.\n\n\t\t  The theme itself comes from openqos-branding.\n\t\t-->\n\t\t<bootsplash-theme>openqos</bootsplash-theme>"}
